{"id": "official:sentence:e1df5695-7e64-4c4d-92e7-a58cdfc2ef2a", "text": "你可能跟我不同意。", "shortMeaning": "你也许不同意我的看法。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f7e812fb-e382-48d3-82d6-4b28c6e18d94", "text": "你吃了这药，胃痛就会缓解很多。", "shortMeaning": "吃了这药，胃疼会轻不少。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd97e91d-033e-4f9e-bdaf-003c2f49ac93", "text": "你吉他弹得非常好。", "shortMeaning": "你吉他弹得真好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:63057849-4c3b-4150-983a-a4d6e115b98b", "text": "你听得懂德语，对吧？", "shortMeaning": "德语你听得懂，对吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a91fb3b4-7954-46a1-a2a9-a20dfd3a17b0", "text": "你听懂他说的了吗？", "shortMeaning": "他说的你听懂了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:384ce78e-5c38-43ca-91a7-67412ce7f650", "text": "你听见有人按门铃了吗？", "shortMeaning": "有人按门铃，你听见了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:24220013-03f8-4bb4-9d8c-b6d4b9739503", "text": "你听说过尼斯湖水怪吗？", "shortMeaning": "尼斯湖有水怪的说法你听过吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1cc65f1-58c7-4e7a-b5e8-b44eff58028a", "text": "你听说过这样的事吗？", "shortMeaning": "这样的事你听过吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:672eba81-5ae7-4d48-af3f-9c417223f48d", "text": "你听过别人说世界语吗？", "shortMeaning": "你听人讲过世界语吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:091d0f7a-75da-4be6-8934-5ea4b519310e", "text": "你听过她讲英语吗？", "shortMeaning": "她讲英语你听过吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d7bc6be-8809-4018-8d69-a1bf16f3ee10", "text": "你听过这首曲子吗？", "shortMeaning": "这支曲子你听过吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:daa5b5fc-dd8e-4c56-b505-b5178ef63dce", "text": "你告诉了他们什么？", "shortMeaning": "你跟他们说了些什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cab7ddcf-7277-4c4b-90f7-46e26866fd14", "text": "你呢？你相信这个人吗？", "shortMeaning": "你呢？这个人你信吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f30fbf76-9acd-4003-a1ee-2c88b83c427a", "text": "你周日晚上能来吗？", "shortMeaning": "礼拜天晚上你能来吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:499cac36-3f19-4e0b-8505-0136d76b428b", "text": "你周末过得怎么样？", "shortMeaning": "你周末过得怎样？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ff22c656-8119-4566-815a-6bfcdda24703", "text": "你和他的田地之间的分界在哪里？", "shortMeaning": "你跟他那两块地的界在哪儿？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c77be21-10d6-4529-af12-abac416fdd85", "text": "你和他说也没有用。", "shortMeaning": "你跟他说也没用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3cab2788-7b10-47c5-8280-894e0c4eb529", "text": "你和你妈用上海话聊天的时候，我只听得懂几个词，所以我插不上话。", "shortMeaning": "你跟你妈讲上海话，我只听懂几个词，插不上话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:96775cce-3229-4cca-a7bf-b17e27c821c3", "text": "你和我一起看场电影吗？", "shortMeaning": "跟我看场电影好吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e88d9ed9-8eba-45e9-b4e2-af0f1395b678", "text": "你和我在这里很安全。", "shortMeaning": "你跟我在这儿很踏实。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05f47c03-6548-4e51-a8e5-4cfe5893365b", "text": "你和我有一些共同点。", "shortMeaning": "你我有些相像的地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:215de61b-fd5b-4b62-b8f4-9ef3c22e657e", "text": "你和我有相同的想法。", "shortMeaning": "你我想到一处去了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:03942dbd-bd7f-48a7-bd05-7dcf96e4fa85", "text": "你和我说话的时候还好，你一停下来我就饿了。", "shortMeaning": "你跟我说话还好，你一停我就饿了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34277076-3ac7-41ff-a3fc-af1bdfaf9d7b", "text": "你咕咕哝哝的来着。", "shortMeaning": "你方才嘟囔了几句。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2df60148-99f5-4367-b5f3-5260d2edcc54", "text": "你咳嗽、打喷嚏或打哈欠的时候要捂住你的嘴。", "shortMeaning": "咳嗽、打喷嚏、打哈欠都要捂住嘴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7726d4ee-c666-47cb-8b7a-bf461d2110fc", "text": "你喜欢你的新工作吗？", "shortMeaning": "新差事你喜欢吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fea25348-0394-409f-9e02-00d1aaec6a6d", "text": "你喝了十一瓶啤酒了！", "shortMeaning": "你已经喝了十一瓶啤酒！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1529e804-cc2e-4486-b283-e03c5898e3ae", "text": "你回来之前我已经走了。", "shortMeaning": "你没回来我就走了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:504cad49-b4e6-42fd-a91a-f2382b32a68b", "text": "你回来的时候我们再说。", "shortMeaning": "等你回来再说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e6b61327-1f88-4134-ae40-e4ae893cc20e", "text": "你回来的时候，我已经走了。", "shortMeaning": "你回来那会儿，我早走了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c8b50736-6abc-4575-912a-cc59fd14b758", "text": "你回过你的国家吗？", "shortMeaning": "你回过自己的国家吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b478e741-5810-41db-8543-1953a5c63af4", "text": "你在一个安全的地方。", "shortMeaning": "你在个稳妥的地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4d3c4e13-c48c-4ed3-b3e6-740aee605a22", "text": "你在三田市住了多久？", "shortMeaning": "三田市你住了多久？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:71056eaa-7874-4512-8daf-cc07ce70a969", "text": "你在东京如何维持生计？", "shortMeaning": "你在东京靠什么度日？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0838560c-1a23-4a0e-8438-ee46e870d6a6", "text": "你在任何一家邮局都能买到邮票。", "shortMeaning": "哪家邮局都能买到邮票。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55d24118-6e96-4a80-9bb7-935fc18f4af0", "text": "你在任何书店都可以买到。", "shortMeaning": "随便哪家书店都买得到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fabdc9f2-a8ab-4079-bb0a-5d7ecea357dd", "text": "你在你的床下面藏了多少钱？", "shortMeaning": "你在床底下藏了多少钱？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ecf14e8-3582-496c-929d-463fc4e3f96a", "text": "你在你的车上装雪地轮了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你车上装了雪地胎吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58f74e84-05bc-4ebc-b4d6-7eb0e2daa020", "text": "你在公园做过爱吗？", "shortMeaning": "你在公园里有过性行为吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:edd90414-e3c0-4d62-b7b6-5cb865f0fd1e", "text": "你在哪儿修的照相机？", "shortMeaning": "你的相机在哪儿修的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3f183500-067b-4752-9756-9aa6b18df440", "text": "你在哪儿看到了她？", "shortMeaning": "你在哪儿看见她的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12f97f97-8e6f-4ab2-93b3-bc221dae4c53", "text": "你在哪儿？ 我在花园中。", "shortMeaning": "问人在哪儿，答说在园子里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:11542af6-cac4-465a-aef9-1e2d4c700a8b", "text": "你在哪里和他们握的手？", "shortMeaning": "你在哪儿跟他们握的手？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6cf1bd3-6cf0-4b00-8131-650e2f6b7918", "text": "你在哪里学的意大利语？", "shortMeaning": "你意大利语在哪儿学的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0988f37b-dff7-495f-8780-492f17dbe527", "text": "你在哪里找打了这个皮夹？", "shortMeaning": "这钱夹你在哪儿找着的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af64cbf3-9044-45c4-ad7b-f7fa67aacd67", "text": "你在哪里看见他了？", "shortMeaning": "你在哪儿见着他的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:60ca6d1d-8e69-430c-98d2-6c1d252665f3", "text": "你在哪里说世界语？", "shortMeaning": "你在哪儿讲世界语？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:44f42be4-c81a-4b24-b66b-471c3d7ba33e", "text": "你在国外待了多久？", "shortMeaning": "你在外国住了多久？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2715e05-d262-4157-a4a8-ff488318fcb2", "text": "你在大学碰到他了？", "shortMeaning": "你在大学里碰上他了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:483f2d3e-39d9-4892-a890-71d7f442daa4", "text": "你在大阪住了多久？", "shortMeaning": "大阪你住过多久？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08a52e71-21ce-4dc0-8e98-e7cef02a2127", "text": "你在家安心休息，先不要考虑工作的事。", "shortMeaning": "在家好好歇着，先别想活儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bb9f8c02-b2ac-4b95-b7b4-2c641053db31", "text": "你在家里不说英语。", "shortMeaning": "你在家不说英语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:455d8d0c-245f-41d1-b43e-f8b6b3029d7a", "text": "你在巴黎的话，就可以去参观卢浮宫了。", "shortMeaning": "你要在巴黎，就能去逛卢浮宫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43185098-dcfc-438a-a7ea-ff35ae0f7895", "text": "你在我旁边，现在一切都好了。", "shortMeaning": "你在我身边，什么都好了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9bb3de6-483f-4a1a-b09b-caa6cbbdae92", "text": "你在把新的名字放在程序里面。", "shortMeaning": "你正把新名字填进程序里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a394962a-bf85-4b4b-8dd9-b9f49485e359", "text": "你在日本住多久了？", "shortMeaning": "你在日本住了多久了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a5618512-dcd3-407f-be96-d17f0db246b2", "text": "你在日本逗留多少天？", "shortMeaning": "你在日本待多少天？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eaecf1f0-8aa2-424b-a2e0-54a009c00de2", "text": "你在没有人会去找的地方找到了我。", "shortMeaning": "你在没人会去的地方把我找到了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cb717717-8b99-4674-bbdd-665404f60f79", "text": "你在波士顿住了多久？", "shortMeaning": "波士顿你住了多久？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:efaa57b2-116e-4ddc-8234-f7b102bfe32d", "text": "你在波士顿做了什么？", "shortMeaning": "波士顿那阵你干了些什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:07474c89-027e-404d-bb7b-1ba8cc9623f8", "text": "你在波士顿再待多久？", "shortMeaning": "你在波士顿还要待多久？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cdc6f669-1969-4a24-9929-f7eb83f2315c", "text": "你在波士顿待了很久吗？", "shortMeaning": "你在波士顿待了很长时间吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:755017c6-6695-4b5a-90c4-a3f80372d014", "text": "你在波士顿花了多少钱？", "shortMeaning": "波士顿一趟你花了多少钱？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a66ae180-fd79-429f-8a07-98a8d25339a2", "text": "你在澳大利亚期间想做什么呢？", "shortMeaning": "在澳洲那些日子你想做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fbae4b72-d58d-4073-bbbf-52038597a610", "text": "你在电视上看足球赛了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你在电视上看球赛了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:188c0bb7-cb14-4565-b804-3abb26abb97e", "text": "你在监狱里呆了多久？", "shortMeaning": "你在牢里蹲了多久？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e46feb25-cc39-444c-bdce-78ba33909255", "text": "你在私立高中读书吗？", "shortMeaning": "你在私立高中念书吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b952de64-8970-4642-bee8-db98c2f58181", "text": "你在笑我还是怎样？我跟你说了三次不要说话好好听课。", "shortMeaning": "你笑我还是怎么？我说过三回上课别讲话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01aa837b-c187-4950-9c3b-49b96506ea74", "text": "你在计划什么出游吗？", "shortMeaning": "你在打算出去走走吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8e4efbc1-1c0a-4681-aa26-c3fec70e84e5", "text": "你在说我有生命危险吗？", "shortMeaning": "你是说我会没命吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79232037-36a1-46df-ba77-8d2363d1255d", "text": "你在车站遇到的男人是我爸爸。", "shortMeaning": "你在车站碰见的男人是我父亲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a774e74b-282e-498b-9976-38a0f3adac67", "text": "你在这个时候才回来真是太过分了。", "shortMeaning": "你这会儿才回来，太不像话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:499a42e1-a8d1-4adf-a1cd-5d0d2aeb637d", "text": "你在这儿的时候想做什么？", "shortMeaning": "你在这儿的那些天想做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f51d765a-49f2-4936-8c70-949c23415104", "text": "你在这种情况下会说什么？", "shortMeaning": "这种情况你会怎么说？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2899b47f-6ff0-468b-9840-cd7d65f786eb", "text": "你在这里当一个好人很危险。", "shortMeaning": "在这儿做好人很险。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d1d98f6-a7e9-43fd-b78e-c5ba858f018a", "text": "你在这里是要见谁吧？", "shortMeaning": "你在这儿是要见谁吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2eeea3a1-47c7-47e1-89bf-f42280a19da4", "text": "你在那么暗的地方做什么？", "shortMeaning": "你在那么黑的地方做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:797133e0-7b42-41c2-8f85-a420c4655936", "text": "你在那儿住了多久了？", "shortMeaning": "那儿你住了多长时间？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d75127c0-7db2-4eeb-8b0d-afd9207484b3", "text": "你在那边见到的男人是我伯伯。", "shortMeaning": "你在那边见到的人是我伯父。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d52aeb4b-817c-4853-b48c-6be404ee4f95", "text": "你在那里做什么呢？", "shortMeaning": "你在那儿干什么呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:feb35bc1-f766-4a25-b988-907587d93ebb", "text": "你在那里待了多久？", "shortMeaning": "你在那儿待了多久？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34538457-4481-4d6d-8e5e-2b7167d39d3f", "text": "你在那里看到了什么？", "shortMeaning": "在那儿你都见着什么了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12ee1a5d-6090-47e2-b552-f12edb67c867", "text": "你在阁楼上做了什么？", "shortMeaning": "你在阁楼上干了什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:635b9d82-9b92-4996-9c1f-9762ba9b5a20", "text": "你在高中的时候胖吗？", "shortMeaning": "你上高中时胖吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30fb9036-f65d-40a2-8c6c-773790c6812e", "text": "你坐下来，有什么不舒服？", "shortMeaning": "你坐下，哪儿不舒服？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b10e03cd-8376-4b6e-8ea0-14055eae9202", "text": "你堂兄叫什么名字？", "shortMeaning": "你堂兄叫什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a05bdc9d-1c14-4bc6-badf-84eb77f5b26c", "text": "你声音大一点，我听不出来！", "shortMeaning": "你大声些，我听不清！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:710cee36-f240-4cc0-bf80-a7d11cd39c4a", "text": "你多久用一次手机？", "shortMeaning": "你多久用一回手机？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cca5b2e5-871b-4e0e-a610-259d1b054007", "text": "你多久看一次牙医？", "shortMeaning": "你多久看一回牙？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b947b12-56ac-4586-b1ec-c618c9f3947b", "text": "你大得足够养活自己了。", "shortMeaning": "你大了，能自己养活自己了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49c2ef3a-4035-4b2f-86b6-ff380d4dcac2", "text": "你大约认识多少英文词？", "shortMeaning": "你大概认得多少英文词？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:effdbe0b-be6b-4232-a7c4-c2fdcb0c6923", "text": "你太会胡说八道了！", "shortMeaning": "你太会瞎扯了！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f3bf88f-c215-4bfd-8bd0-3df24f7be7b3", "text": "你太年轻了，还不能做这个。", "shortMeaning": "你太年轻，这事还做不得。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b7b4ae4-be3c-4a56-8747-d8faba6413a8", "text": "你头发上粘着什么东西。", "shortMeaning": "你头发上沾着个什么东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:011942b6-c1f1-4a0a-865b-b26b58337e69", "text": "你好像星期六也要上课啊。", "shortMeaning": "你星期六好像也要上课。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c460e97-dc23-4313-a101-efedf04474aa", "text": "你如果咬我，我也要咬你。", "shortMeaning": "你咬我，我也咬你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01083af7-54f1-42cb-8582-cc834b45c026", "text": "你如果能利用重力，那就这么做吧。", "shortMeaning": "你能借重力就借吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:805fe937-a750-46e9-be8b-49e819a7892d", "text": "你如果需要帮助，就告诉我。", "shortMeaning": "你要帮忙就说一声。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1cc6afe6-5bc0-4794-9923-eca9df13578e", "text": "你如果需要雨伞，那我借你一把。", "shortMeaning": "你要伞，我借你一把。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d39fa2f7-687a-4fa1-8cee-c329b81c8dad", "text": "你妈妈在这里工作吗？", "shortMeaning": "你母亲在这儿做事吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c599be0-1239-4262-ab3c-614483bd9b64", "text": "你学世界语进展如何？", "shortMeaning": "你学世界语学到哪儿了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf0ae5dc-b300-4e45-b0fa-711334f07758", "text": "你学了几年的汉语？", "shortMeaning": "你汉语学了几年？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a948e12-5284-4fba-b5c4-6d808e6ff449", "text": "你学英语学了好久了？", "shortMeaning": "你英语学了很长时间了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:09ceb3d1-8790-460d-82f6-701233227c1c", "text": "你完成你的功课了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你功课做完了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b05061f6-98d3-4954-945a-9c507c7b17b2", "text": "你实在是太不讲理了！", "shortMeaning": "你实在太不讲理了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e08d29fa-2dff-48d0-bde2-c381f654745c", "text": "你实际上想说什么？", "shortMeaning": "你到底想说什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:54a1cdac-92a8-47b0-815f-390525b60a56", "text": "你家后院有几种鸟？", "shortMeaning": "你家后院有哪几种鸟？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7a547d28-4afd-4c27-9543-ce97b4685e79", "text": "你家好脏啊！你多久没打扫卫生？", "shortMeaning": "你家真脏！多久没擦了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12966b10-0065-4e05-a11b-6ea30c4e5a4b", "text": "你家是我家的三倍大。", "shortMeaning": "你家有我家三倍大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de2d3cc9-011d-4574-aa34-7775098e8007", "text": "你家的电脑在桌子上吗？", "shortMeaning": "你家电脑在桌上吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55cc5e5b-b82c-4f5c-a981-79091f44a19c", "text": "你家里人都还好吗？", "shortMeaning": "你家里人都好吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cecbb536-70d0-4d14-b1c0-b7a5b1a2824b", "text": "你对中国有什么印象？", "shortMeaning": "你对中国的印象怎样？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6873b41b-0004-4572-8362-237278e615f0", "text": "你对于现在的年轻人有什么看法？", "shortMeaning": "眼下这拨年轻人你怎么看？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:437e4375-32f7-4860-8044-b477b89d401d", "text": "你对什么都太怀疑了。", "shortMeaning": "你什么都不肯信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65f41587-a1ec-470d-b9a6-6cd2cc328ac9", "text": "你对他的印象怎么样？", "shortMeaning": "你觉得他怎么样？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:280236ca-0d14-41cc-92ee-5ce0f0362e21", "text": "你对他的回答不感到惊讶吗？", "shortMeaning": "他那样答，你不觉得意外？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b402d6b-99c7-4b8d-b261-66b3028ca475", "text": "你对古典音乐会有什么可说的吗？", "shortMeaning": "古典音乐会你有什么要说的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c345e7a-6274-475e-b4da-555e23526cff", "text": "你对复合碳水化合物有什么了解吗？", "shortMeaning": "复合碳水你知道多少？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ef83a90c-d3bc-4075-bc84-923e6c2bf3a0", "text": "你对她是不是一见钟情？", "shortMeaning": "你是不是一见面就喜欢上她了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d4fe864d-cd03-4804-9f23-17c712009780", "text": "你对待身边的人太冷漠了。", "shortMeaning": "你对身边的人太冷了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b0f96b81-7e1c-42b5-ab4f-acb7c9effff7", "text": "你对我真是太好了。", "shortMeaning": "你待我真是好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd79b7d0-eae4-464b-a078-afc2f6849e70", "text": "你对我那么没耐心。", "shortMeaning": "你对我这么没耐性。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:48782d0f-b541-44f3-a90e-27aa4be50839", "text": "你对政治感兴趣吗？", "shortMeaning": "政治你有兴趣吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0b0575c4-2642-4e5a-9c63-7ea7d86553ff", "text": "你对日本音乐感兴趣吗？", "shortMeaning": "日本音乐你爱听吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ad395426-ffca-44c0-a876-dfeeb2d81afb", "text": "你对美国印象如何？", "shortMeaning": "你对美国有什么印象？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:77f03dde-a35d-437f-8aa8-9b4c268dfb44", "text": "你对自己没有足够的信心。", "shortMeaning": "你对自己信心不足。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e77c1622-7a49-48af-b8b9-a69b2f081b39", "text": "你对语言感兴趣吗？", "shortMeaning": "语言你有兴趣吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:87afacdd-3237-48b9-a012-7554a925665f", "text": "你对这一切有什么感想？", "shortMeaning": "这些事你有什么想法？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a9c8425-67dd-4df8-bd26-7884baf92b10", "text": "你对这件事有什么看法？", "shortMeaning": "这事你怎么看？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:14f963b7-a17e-4df0-9e0f-ae4984afc706", "text": "你对音乐感不感兴趣？", "shortMeaning": "音乐你感不感兴趣？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba3bd5c6-6c15-49e9-a3d6-ef3f778e0690", "text": "你将为我们唱英文歌吗？", "shortMeaning": "你会给我们唱首英文歌吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc62ad57-8f4e-4f46-88fb-cac7af49a384", "text": "你将要把我逼疯了！", "shortMeaning": "你快把我逼疯了！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ba05461-9ca0-4ceb-85df-ef810dc05b93", "text": "你少把一切都推到他头上。", "shortMeaning": "别什么都往他身上推。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e94b3115-1dda-470a-9052-2cb993f1391d", "text": "你尝过那么好喝的汤吗？", "shortMeaning": "你喝过那么好喝的汤吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:218f6eba-886d-4c81-9942-842b1c53263b", "text": "你尤其不该空腹喝酒。", "shortMeaning": "你更不该空着肚子喝。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a5713815-4d8b-4849-af7f-262e60d44a35", "text": "你就不能等一等，和我好好商量一下吗？", "shortMeaning": "你就不能等等，跟我好好商量吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:74d59995-7013-437c-82da-de927eea9a43", "text": "你就只告诉我一个人，你对她的意见如何？", "shortMeaning": "只告诉我一个，你看她怎样？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b01122e3-68b0-44ab-b736-aaac413727c0", "text": "你就只抄了这么多张啊？", "shortMeaning": "你就抄了这么几张啊？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e5d69d87-2691-410f-94ef-e253da16e888", "text": "你就是我一直要找的人。", "shortMeaning": "我一直在找的就是你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a74d7129-420f-406b-808f-4de67b83f9bd", "text": "你就是我在等的人。", "shortMeaning": "我等的人就是你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b4b56d32-bfee-40b7-ae69-2b87d3533c0c", "text": "你就算不想做，也一定要做。", "shortMeaning": "你不想做也得做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2d10cf6-f8d5-484d-bd61-1bc4335da2a8", "text": "你就算不想走也要走。", "shortMeaning": "你不想走也得走。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:529fcefa-c0c7-4559-a66a-fe4de8424a13", "text": "你就让着我一点嘛。", "shortMeaning": "你就让着我些吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e341d4a0-6d33-4636-8714-018cc8984636", "text": "你就随了我的意吧。", "shortMeaning": "你就依了我吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:767e88ec-8205-4174-82bd-df20b3ba6f36", "text": "你工作太勤奋了。休息一会吧。", "shortMeaning": "你太拼了，歇一会儿吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0abdadd7-f614-40f4-8632-46a9d08c79d0", "text": "你已经不再年轻了。", "shortMeaning": "你已经不年轻了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:77c56efa-9944-4404-9cf2-9c0d6c0975a0", "text": "你已经从语言进入到文化了。", "shortMeaning": "你已从语言钻到文化里了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e96a6b06-d801-416f-88b8-b8345330668d", "text": "你已经出过国了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你已经出过国了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca4f6db2-bfb3-4042-9242-264988539a41", "text": "你已经去过夏威夷了吗？", "shortMeaning": "夏威夷你去过了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d8a92f2-f844-46a7-8824-f4b99874ec53", "text": "你已经吃了很多馅饼。", "shortMeaning": "你已经吃了不少馅饼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:041cb5e6-868a-45f9-b3be-682348b61434", "text": "你已经吃过香蕉挞了吗？", "shortMeaning": "香蕉挞你吃过了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6e9a02fc-061a-4dbd-80b8-fc3b587d836c", "text": "你已经在京都了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你已经到京都了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9b6dc736-6c14-4efc-b8c9-7e2a783c3051", "text": "你已经引起了我的注意。", "shortMeaning": "你已经让我留意上了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:486bde05-5ef8-4d72-aedf-e471af468387", "text": "你已经忘记了一切吗？", "shortMeaning": "你把一切都忘了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22a4b38c-dbe9-4935-830a-e6d4aca10210", "text": "你已经把所有的钱都用光了吧？", "shortMeaning": "你的钱都花光了吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:882ed38f-3f4a-4198-a619-929a872217a7", "text": "你已经有了很多机会。", "shortMeaning": "你机会已经不少了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f5af3d20-0260-46d8-a6b7-6adc804f0380", "text": "你已经有人陪伴了。", "shortMeaning": "你身边已经有人陪了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:70c8afa5-470e-413f-b7b7-cfd2b732ece8", "text": "你已经知道了，不是吗？", "shortMeaning": "你已经知道了，是吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:68e98b90-671d-4793-a256-8077eee79222", "text": "你已经知道答案了，还问我问题干吗？", "shortMeaning": "答案你都知道了，还问我做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f5ed3117-4b4d-42e1-976a-e3674927ac26", "text": "你已经给了我足够多的钱。", "shortMeaning": "你给我的钱已经够多了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1a7d687-49f2-4f21-b39f-3d59ec27aca3", "text": "你已经置身于汉语中了。", "shortMeaning": "你已经泡在汉语里了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2736f366-8798-4835-8969-7c01a0443ec4", "text": "你已经见过史密斯先生了吗？", "shortMeaning": "史密斯先生你见过了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b737f19-4ad6-43ab-aa6c-855d4d83ac64", "text": "你希望我们和你一起去吗？", "shortMeaning": "你想我们跟你一道去吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3773d4b-c9b3-4009-94ec-3fbed4d70ea1", "text": "你带没带移动硬盘？", "shortMeaning": "你带移动硬盘了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6800927a-f5ad-4f2e-85a5-9e73d1902219", "text": "你常常出差，东南西北闯闯，太潇洒啦！", "shortMeaning": "你常出差，四处跑，真自在！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:54333198-0852-4ba7-b11b-eace4ddce590", "text": "你常常去电影院吗？", "shortMeaning": "你常上电影院吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0ab34fba-165a-4fa2-b59f-5de2b4be9b7f", "text": "你干什么给她钱呢？", "shortMeaning": "你给她钱做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e8e8000d-ba54-43dd-8b07-a52566e6a807", "text": "你年龄足够大了，该了解更多。", "shortMeaning": "你岁数够了，该懂更多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e9fe96c-4b5f-4902-9458-4c903852da75", "text": "你应当多运动运动。", "shortMeaning": "你该多活动活动。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51041cc0-bde9-4058-8046-028ef52a6f5f", "text": "你应当知道要读什么。", "shortMeaning": "你该知道读什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9dacc11a-3a8a-4b84-a343-e6ae3f468e01", "text": "你应该努力忘掉那些不快乐的过去。", "shortMeaning": "你该尽力忘掉那些不痛快的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9d8bffa-3d06-4218-80bb-bc58efa3b03b", "text": "你应该去找份工作了。", "shortMeaning": "你该去找个差事了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:10c911c8-adaa-43fa-b4b3-226389fd2ba1", "text": "你应该听他的话，他说的有道理，更何况他是为了你好。", "shortMeaning": "你该听他，他讲得在理，也是为你好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2fd3db76-101e-40f7-bac2-3a99819199f1", "text": "你应该戒烟，因为不健康。", "shortMeaning": "你该戒烟，抽烟伤身。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1ca984a-2e4c-4a57-a553-947356dd0495", "text": "你应该每天睡八个小时觉。", "shortMeaning": "你一天该睡八个钟头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e5414217-0113-4a53-8ba2-61c1e5c354df", "text": "你应该现在就回家。", "shortMeaning": "你现在就该回家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ca4ab01-5563-4bda-9125-a73391a8c68a", "text": "你应该给你的孩子们树立好的榜样。", "shortMeaning": "你该给孩子做个好样子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1769bc5c-fe6a-4936-b234-2f5cf42a2440", "text": "你应该考虑的第一件事是时间。", "shortMeaning": "你头一样要考虑的是时间。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d58ebd4c-5933-4578-9d6c-eacaa29c8cd9", "text": "你应该要尝试著忘掉不快乐的过去。", "shortMeaning": "你该试着把不快的旧事放下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0fe2d284-117c-49e9-8f1f-a6b95ffd8e9d", "text": "你应该认真考虑在这里工作的事。", "shortMeaning": "在这儿做事，你该好好想想。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:96e93c14-6f5b-4378-b191-38ca7a4066eb", "text": "你应该让个医生看看。", "shortMeaning": "你该让大夫瞧瞧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00e94909-8b45-46fc-b27c-b325e740a60c", "text": "你应该让你的儿子独立了。", "shortMeaning": "你该让儿子自己去闯了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7b05dfa-871c-4e42-99de-e7f3a1dd7d6e", "text": "你应该跳个槽，我介绍你到我连襟的公司去做他的搭档。", "shortMeaning": "你该换个差事，我荐你去我连襟那儿搭伙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bec4a3f0-92ee-4174-8209-f84f338d893e", "text": "你度过了很不安宁的一夜。", "shortMeaning": "你这一夜过得很不安稳。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d5efc97c-9f82-4cfc-91cc-96c4775fe518", "text": "你度过愉快的时光了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你玩得开心吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7beb6222-63bb-4ec7-8ff0-0cb37b5fceb0", "text": "你开始学世界语了。", "shortMeaning": "你已经动身学世界语了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd8658e6-6b2a-4294-8bae-64e1871f6b0f", "text": "你开始投简历了吗？", "shortMeaning": "简历你开始投了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d5984c1-d1ad-4d58-95af-32b82fdc7d86", "text": "你开通免密支付了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你开了免密付吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:78823dc2-ce49-4fd5-83fa-038761e9da1b", "text": "你当我说话在放屁，是吗？", "shortMeaning": "你当我说话是放屁，是不是？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b6c6a70-d53e-4842-b960-3d23232f0fb9", "text": "你往前走，然后往右转，过了红绿灯就到了。", "shortMeaning": "往前走，再往右拐，过红绿灯就到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97e1436e-8ae7-4ec6-8a91-57dd3717f8a9", "text": "你很儒雅，关于唐诗什么都知道。", "shortMeaning": "你人很斯文，唐诗的事都懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:205d7ced-a77c-4c9d-bed7-aec6bb38f3af", "text": "你很好地守住了秘密。", "shortMeaning": "你把秘密守得很好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5b8f2512-f5f5-463b-a690-b5e5c4cf128e", "text": "你很容易把母语说得通顺流畅，却很容易把非母语说得不自然。", "shortMeaning": "母语张口就顺，外语一说明显别扭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b92ddb8-8165-4941-8741-52e0eebe889a", "text": "你很快就会习惯住在这里。", "shortMeaning": "你很快会惯于住在这儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d1ee3a57-44e8-4109-9ca9-9936215c539a", "text": "你很快就会习惯吃日本料理了。", "shortMeaning": "日本菜你很快会吃惯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:baa6e051-8a92-42e0-b832-094edbfa3ed6", "text": "你很快就会习惯在大庭广众说话了。", "shortMeaning": "你很快会惯于当众讲话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d483afcf-0071-4bb5-a5a7-e6756082d41b", "text": "你很清楚我想要什么。", "shortMeaning": "我要什么你心里很清楚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e231273d-85e8-4e11-b51f-1307115f08ed", "text": "你很诚实地承认了你的错误。", "shortMeaning": "你很老实地认了自己的错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b4e1d6f3-fd13-49e7-9714-2b5363ce0ad3", "text": "你得了解俄语才能学这门语言。", "shortMeaning": "要学这门语言你得懂俄语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79d09077-7ae0-459c-b404-8af3462be6ab", "text": "你得在星期天工作吗？", "shortMeaning": "你星期天也得干活吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
